window.MEMORIAE = {"1002|S. Leodegarii Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"1002","la":"S. Leodegarii Ep. et Mart.","or":["Lætétur Ecclésia tua, Deus, beáti Leodegárii Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis confísa suffrágiis: atque eius précibus gloriósis, et devóta permáneat; et secúra consístat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your Church rejoice, O God, trusting in the prayers of blessed Leodegarius, Your Martyr and Bishop; and by his glorious intercession may she remain devout and stand secure; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in eius tibi solemnitáte deférimus, cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of him by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 02/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1007|S. Marci Papæ et Conf.":{"md":"1007","la":"S. Marci Papæ et Conf.","or":["Exáudi Dómine preces nostras: et interveniénte beáto Marco Confessóre tuo atque Pontífice; supplicatiónes nostras placátus inténde: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear our prayers, O Lord, and at the intercession of blessed Mark, Your Confessor and Bishop, mercifully attend to our supplications; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut de percéptis munéribus grátias exhibéntes; intercedénte beáto Marco Confessóre tuo atque Pontífice, benefícia potióra sumámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who give thanks for the gifts we have received may, at the intercession of blessed Mark, Your Confessor and Bishop, obtain still greater benefits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 07/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1007|SS. Sergii, Bacchi, Marcelli et Apuleji MM.":{"md":"1007","la":"SS. Sergii, Bacchi, Marcelli et Apuleji MM.","or":["Sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum nos, Dómine, Sérgii, Bacchi, Marcélli, et Apuléii beáta mérita prosequántur; et tuo semper fáciant amóre fervéntes: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the blessed merits of Your holy Martyrs Sergius, Bacchus, Marcellus and Apuleius go with us, O Lord, and make us ever fervent in Your love; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Maiestátem tuam nobis, Dómine quǽsumus, hæc hóstia reddat immolánda placátam, tuórum digna postulatióne Sanctórum. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this sacrifice, offered at the worthy prayer of Your Saints, make Your majesty favourable to us, we beseech You, O Lord; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sacraméntis, Dómine, muniámur accéptis: et sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum interveniéntibus méritis; contra omnes nequítias irruéntes, armis cæléstibus protegámur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Strengthened by the sacraments we have received, O Lord, may we, through the merits of Your holy Martyrs, be protected by heavenly arms against every wickedness that assails us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 07/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1021|SS. Ursulæ et Sociarum VV. et MM.":{"md":"1021","la":"SS. Ursulæ et Sociarum VV. et MM.","or":["Da nobis, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster, sanctárum Vírginum et Mártyrum tuárum Ursulæ et sociárum eius palmas incessábili devotióne venerári: ut quas digna mente non póssumus celebráre; humílibus saltem frequentémus obséquiis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord our God, to venerate with unceasing devotion the palms of Your holy Virgins and Martyrs Ursula and her companions; that those whom we cannot honour as they deserve we may at least attend with humble service; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hostiárum nostrárum tibi, Dómine quǽsumus, devótio pláceat: et quod in ea pro nostra fragilitáte deest, beátæ Ursulæ, sociarúmque eius intercéssio súppleat gloriósa. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the devotion of our offerings please You, we beseech You, O Lord; and what is lacking in it through our frailty, may the glorious intercession of blessed Ursula and her companions supply; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus sanctis Virgínibus et Martýribus tuis; ut quod ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of Your holy Virgins and Martyrs, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 21/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1025|SS. Crispini et Crispiniani MM.":{"md":"1025","la":"SS. Crispini et Crispiniani MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos concédis sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Crispíni et Crispiniáni natalítia cólere; da nobis in ætérna beatitúdine de eórum societáte gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who grant us to keep the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Crispin and Crispinian, grant us to rejoice in their company in everlasting bliss; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, nostræ devotiónis offérimus: quæ et pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre Sanctórum, et nobis salutária, te miseránte, reddántur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our devotion, that they may be pleasing to You for the honor of Your saints and, by Your mercy, become salutary to us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Crispíno et Crispiniáno; ut quæ ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Crispin and Crispinian, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 25/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1031|S. Quintini Mart.":{"md":"1031","la":"S. Quintini Mart.","or":["Adésto Dómine supplicatiónibus nostris: ut qui ex iniquitáte nostra reos nos esse cognóscimus: beáti Quintíni Mártyris tui intercessióne liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear our supplications, O Lord, that we who know ourselves guilty through our iniquity may be set free by the intercession of blessed Quintinus, Your Martyr; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Munéribus nostris, quǽsumus Dómine, precibúsque suscéptis: intercedénte beáto Quintíno Mártyre tuo, et cæléstibus nos munda mystériis, et cleménter exáudi. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive our gifts and prayers, we beseech You, O Lord; and at the intercession of blessed Quintinus, Your Martyr, cleanse us by these heavenly mysteries and graciously hear us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui cæléstia aliménta percépimus; intercedénte beáto Quintíno Mártyre tuo, per hæc contra ómnia advérsa muniámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have received the food of heaven may, at the intercession of blessed Quintinus, Your Martyr, be fortified by it against all adversity; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 31/10; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1104|SS. Vitalis et Agricolæ MM.":{"md":"1104","la":"SS. Vitalis et Agricolæ MM.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Vitális et Agrícolæ solémnia cólimus; eórum apud te intercessiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of Your blessed Martyrs Vitalis and Agricola may be helped by their intercession with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Vitális et Agrícolæ dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme: et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of Your blessed Martyrs Vitalis and Agricola, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui cæléstia aliménta percépimus; intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Vitále et Agrícola, per hæc contra ómnia advérsa muniámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have received the food of heaven may, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Vitalis and Agricola, be fortified by it against all adversity; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 04/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1108|SS. Quatuor Coronatorum MM.":{"md":"1108","la":"SS. Quatuor Coronatorum MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui gloriósos Mártyres fortes in sua confessióne cognóvimus; pios apud te in nostra intercessióne sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have known the glorious martyrs to be steadfast in their confession may feel them to be loving intercessors for us with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Benedíctio tua Dómine larga descéndat: quæ et múnera nostra, deprecántibus sanctis Martýribus tuis, tibi reddat accépta, et nobis sacraméntum redemptiónis effíciat. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May Your blessing, O Lord, come down abundantly, that, Your holy martyrs pleading, it may make our gifts acceptable to You and make for us the sacrament of redemption; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Cæléstibus refécti sacraméntis et gáudiis, súpplices te Dómine deprecámur: ut quorum gloriámur triúmphis; protegámur auxíliis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with heavenly sacraments and joys, we humbly pray You, O Lord, that we may be protected by the help of those in whose triumphs we glory; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 08/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1109|S. Theodori Mart.":{"md":"1109","la":"S. Theodori Mart.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Theodóri Mártyris tui confessióne gloriósa circúmdas et prótegis: præsta nobis ex eius imitatióne profícere; et oratióne fulcíri: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who surround and protect us with the glorious confession of blessed Theodore, Your Martyr, grant us to profit by imitating him and to be upheld by his prayer; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine fidélium preces cum oblatiónibus hostiárum: et intercedénte beáto Theodóro Mártyre tuo, per hæc piæ devotiónis offícia, ad cæléstem glóriam transeámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the prayers of the faithful with these offered gifts; and at the intercession of blessed Theodore, Your Martyr, may we pass through these duties of loving devotion to the glory of heaven; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedénte beáto Theodóro Mártyre tuo; ut quod ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of blessed Theodore, Your Martyr, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 09/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1111|S. Mennæ Mart.":{"md":"1111","la":"S. Mennæ Mart.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beáti Mennæ Mártyris tui natalítia cólimus; intercessióne eius in tui nóminis amóre roborémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Mennas, Your Martyr, may by his intercession be strengthened in the love of Your name; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Oblátis, quǽsumus Dómine, placáre munéribus: et intercedénte beáto Menna Mártyre tuo, a cunctis nos defénde perículis. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Be appeased, we beseech You, O Lord, by the gifts we offer, and at the intercession of blessed Mennas, Your Martyr, defend us from all dangers; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sit nobis, Dómine, reparátio mentis et córporis cæléste mystérium: ut cuius exséquimur actiónem; intercedénte beáto Menna Mártyre tuo, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this heavenly mystery, O Lord, renew us in mind and body; that, at the intercession of blessed Mennas, Your Martyr, we may feel the effect of the rite we perform; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 11/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1114|S. Britii Ep. et Conf.":{"md":"1114","la":"S. Britii Ep. et Conf.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut beáti Brítii Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis veneránda solémnitas; et devotiónem nobis áugeat, et salútem: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the venerable feast of blessed Brice, Your Confessor and Bishop, may increase in us both devotion and salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut de percéptis munéribus grátias exhibéntes; intercedénte beáto Brítio Confessóre tuo atque Pontífice, benefícia potióra sumámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who give thanks for the gifts we have received may, at the intercession of blessed Brice, Your Confessor and Bishop, obtain still greater benefits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 14/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1124|S. Chrysogoni Mart.":{"md":"1124","la":"S. Chrysogoni Mart.","or":["Adésto Dómine supplicatiónibus nostris: ut qui ex iniquitáte nostra reos nos esse cognóscimus; beáti Chrysógoni Mártyris tui intercessióne liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear our supplications, O Lord, that we who know ourselves guilty through our iniquity may be set free by the intercession of blessed Chrysogonus, Your Martyr; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Oblátis, quǽsumus Dómine, placáre munéribus: et intercedénte beáto Chrysógono Mártyre tuo, a cunctis nos defénde perículis. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Be appeased, we beseech You, O Lord, by the gifts we offer, and at the intercession of blessed Chrysogonus, Your Martyr, defend us from all dangers; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Tui, Dómine, perceptióne sacraménti, et a nostris mundémur occúltis; et ab hóstium liberémur insídiis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","By receiving Your sacrament, O Lord, may we be cleansed of our secret sins and delivered from the snares of our enemies. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 24/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1129|S. Saturnini Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"1129","la":"S. Saturnini Ep. et Mart.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Saturníni Mártyris tui concédis natalítio pérfrui; eius nos tríbue méritis adiuvári: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who grant us to enjoy the heavenly birthday of blessed Saturninus, Your Martyr, grant that we may be helped by his merits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, dicáta sanctífica, et intercedénte beáto Saturníno Mártyre tuo, per hæc eádem nos placátus inténde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Sanctify, O Lord, the gifts dedicated to You, and at the intercession of blessed Saturninus, Your Martyr, look on us with favour because of them; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sanctíficet nos, quǽsumus Dómine, tui percéptio sacraménti; et intercessióne beáti Saturníni Mártyris tui tibi reddat accéptos: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the receiving of Your sacrament sanctify us, we beseech You, O Lord, and by the intercession of blessed Saturninus, Your Martyr, make us acceptable to You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 29/11; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1204|S. Barbaræ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"1204","la":"S. Barbaræ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Exáudi nos Deus salutáris noster: ut sicut de beátæ Bárbaræ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ festivitáte gaudémus; ita piæ devotiónis erudiámur afféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear us, O God our Saviour, that as we rejoice in the feast of blessed Barbara, Your Virgin and Martyr, so we may learn from it the love of a holy devotion; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta tibi sit, Dómine, sacrátæ plebis oblátio pro tuórum honóre Sanctórum, quorum se méritis de tribulatióne percepísse cognóscit auxílium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the offering of Your consecrated people be acceptable to You, O Lord, in honor of Your saints, through whose merits they acknowledge that they have received help in tribulation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 04/12; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1207|Octava S. Andreæ Apost.":{"md":"1207","la":"Octava S. Andreæ Apost.","or":["Prótegat nos, Dómine, sǽpius beáti Andréæ Apóstoli tui repetíta solémnitas: ut cuius patrocínia sine intermissióne recólimus; perpétuam defensiónem sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the often repeated feast of blessed Andrew, Your Apostle, protect us, O Lord; that, as we honour his patronage without ceasing, we may feel his defence for ever; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Indulgéntiam nobis prǽbeant hæc múnera, quǽsumus Dómine, largiórem: quæ pro venerábilis Andréæ Apóstoli tui suffrágiis offerúntur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May these gifts, offered at the prayers of Your venerable Apostle Andrew, obtain for us, we beseech You, O Lord, a fuller pardon; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Adiuvet famíliam tuam tibi Dómine supplicándo, beátus Andréas Apóstolus: et pius intervéntor efficiátur; qui tui nóminis éxstitit prædicátor: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May blessed Andrew the Apostle help Your family by his prayer to You, O Lord, and may he who was the preacher of Your name be our loving advocate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 07/12; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0102|Octava S. Stephani Protomartyris":{"md":"0102","la":"Octava S. Stephani Protomartyris","or":["Da nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, imitári quod cólimus, ut discámus et inimícos dilígere: quia eius natalítia celebrámus; qui novit étiam pro persecutóribus exoráre: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, to imitate what we honour, that we may learn to love even our enemies; for we keep the heavenly birthday of him who knew how to pray even for his persecutors; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera pro tuórum commemoratióne Sanctórum: ut sicut illos pássio gloriósos effécit, ita nos devótio reddat innócuos. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, these gifts in commemoration of Your saints, that, as their passion made them glorious, so our devotion may make us blameless; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáto Stéphano Mártyre tuo, sempitérna protectióne confírment: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and, by the intercession of blessed Stephen Your martyr, strengthen us with everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 02/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0103|Octava S. Joannis Ap. et Ev.":{"md":"0103","la":"Octava S. Joannis Ap. et Ev.","or":["Ecclésiam tuam, Dómine, benígnus illústra: ut beáti Ioánnis Apóstoli tui et Evangelístæ illumináta doctrínis; ad dona pervéniat sempitérna. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O Lord, graciously shed light upon Your Church, so that, enlightened by the teachings of blessed John, Your Apostle and Evangelist, she may gain Your everlasting rewards. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in eius tibi solemnitáte deférimus, cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of him by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti cibo potúque cælésti, Deus noster, te súpplices exorámus: ut in cuius hæc commemoratióne percépimus; eius muniámur et précibus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with this heavenly food and drink, O our God, we humbly pray that we may be helped by the prayers of him in whose memory we have received it; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 03/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0114|S. Felicis Presb. et Mart.":{"md":"0114","la":"S. Felicis Presb. et Mart.","or":["Concéde, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut ad meliórem vitam Sanctórum tuórum exémpla nos próvocent; quátenus quorum solémnia ágimus, étiam actus imitémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the examples of Your Saints may stir us to a better life; so that, as we keep their feasts, we may also imitate their deeds; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beáti Felícis Mártyris tui dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme; et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of blessed Felix, Your Martyr, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus, Dómine, salutáribus repléti mystériis: ut beáti Felícis Mártyris tui, cuius solémnia celebrámus; oratiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with these saving mysteries, we beseech You, O Lord, that we may be helped by the prayers of blessed Felix, Your Martyr, whose feast we keep; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 14/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0115|S. Mauri Abbatis":{"md":"0115","la":"S. Mauri Abbatis","or":["Intercéssio nos, quǽsumus Dómine; beáti Mauri Abbátis comméndet: ut quod nostris méritis non valémus; eius patrocínio assequámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the intercession of blessed Maurus the Abbot commend us, we beseech You, O Lord; that what we cannot attain by our own merits we may obtain through his patronage; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sacris altáribus, Dómine, hóstias superpósitas sanctus Maurus Abbas, quǽsumus, in salútem nobis proveníre depóscat. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the holy Abbot Maurus, we beseech You, O Lord, ask that the offerings placed upon Your holy altars may avail for our salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Prótegat nos, Dómine, cum tui perceptióne sacraménti, beátus Maurus Abbas pro nobis intercedéndo: ut et conversatiónis eius experiámur insígnia; et intercessiónis ipsíus percipiámus suffrágia: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","With the receiving of Your sacrament, O Lord, may blessed Maurus the Abbot protect us by his intercession; that we may show the marks of his way of life and receive the help of his prayers; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 15/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0115|S. Pauli primi Eremitæ Conf.":{"md":"0115","la":"S. Pauli primi Eremitæ Conf.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Pauli Confessóris tui ánnua solemnitáte lætíficas: concéde propítius, ut cuius natalítia cólimus; étiam actiónes imitémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of blessed Paul, Your Confessor, mercifully grant that, as we keep his heavenly birthday, we may also imitate his deeds; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Laudis tibi Dómine hóstias immolámus in tuórum commemoratióne Sanctórum: quibus nos et præséntibus éxui malis confídimus, et futúris. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, sacrifices of praise in commemoration of Your Saints, through whom we trust to be delivered from evils present and to come; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti cibo potúque cælésti, Deus noster, te súpplices exorámus: ut in cuius hæc commemoratióne percépimus; eius muniámur et précibus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with heavenly food and drink, O our God, we humbly entreat You that we may also be defended by the prayers of her in whose commemoration we have received these gifts; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 15/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0116|S. Marcelli I Papæ et Mart.":{"md":"0116","la":"S. Marcelli I Papæ et Mart.","or":["Preces pópuli tui, quǽsumus Dómine, cleménter exáudi: ut beáti Marcélli Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis méritis adiuvémur; cuius passióne lætámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Mercifully hear the prayers of Your people, we beseech You, O Lord, that we who rejoice in the passion of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr and Bishop, may be helped by his merits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe, quǽsumus Dómine, múnera dignánter obláta, et beáti Marcélli Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis suffragántibus méritis, ad nostræ salútis auxílium proveníre concéde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts we offer, and grant that, through the merits of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr and Bishop, they may avail for our salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti participatióne múneris sacri, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut cuius exséquimur cultum; intercedénte beáto Marcéllo Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by sharing in the holy gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, at the intercession of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr and Bishop, we may feel the effect of the rite we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 16/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0118|S. Priscæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0118","la":"S. Priscæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beátæ Priscæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ natalítia cólimus; et ánnua solemnitáte lætémur, et tantæ fídei proficiámus exémplo: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Prisca, Your Virgin and Martyr, may rejoice in her yearly feast and profit by the example of her great faith; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstia, quǽsumus Dómine, quam tibi, sanctæ Priscæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ natalítia recenséntes, offérimus, et víncula nostræ pravitátis absólvat, et tuæ nobis misericórdiæ dona concíliet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this sacrifice, which we offer You, O Lord, as we recall the heavenly birthday of holy Prisca, Your Virgin and Martyr, loose the bonds of our sinfulness and win for us the gifts of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus, Dómine, salutáribus repléti mystériis: ut cuius solémnia celebrámus; eius oratiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with saving mysteries, we beseech You, O Lord, that we may be helped by the prayers of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 18/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0123|S. Emerentianæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0123","la":"S. Emerentianæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Indulgéntiam nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, beáta Emerentiána Virgo et Martyr implóret: quæ tibi grata semper éxstitit; et mérito castitátis, et tuæ professióne virtútis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May blessed Emerentiana, Virgin and Martyr, implore pardon for us, we beseech You, O Lord, she who was ever pleasing to You by the merit of her chastity and by the profession of Your power; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in beátæ Emerentiánæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte deférimus: cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of blessed Emerentiana, Your Virgin and Martyr, by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáta Emerentiána Vírgine et Mártyre tua, sempitérna protectióne confírment: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and through the intercession of blessed Emerentiana, Your Virgin and Martyr, strengthen us with everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 23/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0124|S. Timothei Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0124","la":"S. Timothei Ep. et Mart.","or":["Lætétur Ecclésia tua, Deus, beáti Timóthei Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis confísa suffrágiis: atque eius précibus gloriósis, et devóta permáneat; et secúra consístat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your Church rejoice, O God, trusting in the prayers of blessed Timothy, Your Martyr and Bishop; and by his glorious intercession may she remain devout and stand secure; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in eius tibi solemnitáte deférimus, cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of him by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 24/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0126|S. Polycarpi Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0126","la":"S. Polycarpi Ep. et Mart.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beáti Polycárpi Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis solémnia cólimus; eius apud te intercessiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of blessed Polycarp, Your Martyr and Bishop, may be helped by his intercession with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut de percéptis munéribus grátias exhibéntes; intercedénte beáto Polycárpo Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, benefícia potióra sumámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who give thanks for the gifts we have received may, at the intercession of blessed Polycarp, Your Martyr and Bishop, obtain still greater benefits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 26/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0127|S. Juliani Ep. et Conf.":{"md":"0127","la":"S. Juliani Ep. et Conf.","or":["Exáudi, quǽsumus Dómine, preces nostras, quas in beáti Iuliáni Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis solemnitáte deférimus: ut qui tibi digne méruit famulári; eius intercedéntibus méritis, ab ómnibus nos absólvas peccátis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear, we beseech You, O Lord, the prayers we offer on the feast of blessed Julian, Your Confessor and Bishop; that through the merits of him who was found worthy to serve You, You may absolve us from all our sins; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta sit in conspéctu tuo Dómine nostra devótio: ut eius nobis fiat supplicatióne salutáris, pro cuius solemnitáte defértur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May our devotion be acceptable in Your sight, O Lord, that it may profit us for salvation through the pleading of him on whose feast it is offered; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Da, quǽsumus Dómine, fidélibus tuis, Sanctórum tuórum semper veneratióne lætári; et eórum perpétua supplicatióne muníri: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant to Your faithful, we beseech You, O Lord, ever to rejoice in the veneration of Your saints, and to be fortified by their unceasing prayer; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 27/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0128|S. Agnetis secundo":{"md":"0128","la":"S. Agnetis secundo","or":["Deus, qui nos ánnua beátæ Agnétis Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte lætíficas: da, quǽsumus, ut quam venerámur offício; étiam piæ conversatiónis sequámur exémplo: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of blessed Agnes, Your Virgin and Martyr, grant, we beseech You, that we may follow the example of the holy life of her whom we honour in this office; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Super has, quǽsumus Dómine, hóstias benedíctio copiósa descéndat: quæ et sanctificatiónem nobis cleménter operétur, et de sanctæ Agnétis Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte lætíficet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May a rich blessing come down upon these offerings, we beseech You, O Lord, mercifully work our sanctification, and make us glad in the feast of holy Agnes, Your Virgin and Martyr; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Súmpsimus, Dómine, celebritátis ánnuæ votíva sacraménta; præsta quǽsumus, ut et temporális vitæ nobis remédia prǽbeant, et ætérnæ: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We have received, O Lord, the votive sacraments of this yearly feast; grant, we beseech You, that they may bring us remedies both for this temporal life and for eternal life; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 28/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0130|S. Martinæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0130","la":"S. Martinæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Deus, qui inter cétera poténtiæ tuæ mirácula, étiam in sexu frágili victóriam martýrii contulísti: concéde propítius, ut qui beátæ Martínæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ natalítia cólimus; per eius ad te exémpla gradiámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who among the other wonders of Your power have given even to the weaker sex the victory of martyrdom, mercifully grant that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Martina, Your Virgin and Martyr, may come to You by following her example; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in beátæ Martínæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte deférimus: cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of blessed Martina, Your Virgin and Martyr, by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáta Martína Vírgine et Mártyre tua, sempitérna fáciant protectióne gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and through the intercession of blessed Martina, Your Virgin and Martyr, make us rejoice in Your everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 30/01; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0206|SS. Vedasti et Amandi Epp. et Confessorum":{"md":"0206","la":"SS. Vedasti et Amandi Epp. et Confessorum","or":["Deus, qui nos sanctórum Confessórum tuórum Vedásti et Amándi confessiónibus gloriósis circúmdas et prótegis: da nobis eórum imitatióne profícere; et intercessióne gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who surround and protect us with the glorious confessions of Your holy Confessors Vedast and Amand, grant us to profit by imitating them and to rejoice in their intercession; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus, Dómine, salutáribus repléti mystériis: ut quorum solémnia celebrámus; eórum oratiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the saving mysteries, we beseech You, O Lord, that we may be helped by the prayers of those whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 06/02; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0214|S. Valentini Mart.":{"md":"0214","la":"S. Valentini Mart.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beáti Valentíni Mártyris tui natalítia cólimus; a cunctis malis imminéntibus eius intercessióne liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Valentine, Your Martyr, may by his intercession be delivered from all the evils that threaten us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beáti Valentíni Mártyris tui dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme: et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of blessed Valentine, Your Martyr, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sumptis, Dómine, sacraméntis: quǽsumus, ut intercedénte beáto Valentíno Mártyre tuo; supplicatiónes nostras placátus inténdas: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Having received Your sacraments, O Lord, we beseech You that, at the intercession of blessed Valentine, Your Martyr, You may look with favour on our supplications; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 14/02; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0301|S. Albini Ep. et Conf.":{"md":"0301","la":"S. Albini Ep. et Conf.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut beáti Albíni Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis veneránda solémnitas; et devotiónem nobis áugeat, et salútem: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the venerable feast of blessed Albinus, Your Confessor and Bishop, may increase in us both devotion and salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut de percéptis munéribus grátias exhibéntes; intercedénte beáto Albíno Confessóre tuo atque Pontífice, benefícia potióra sumámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who give thanks for the gifts we have received may, at the intercession of blessed Albinus, Your Confessor and Bishop, obtain still greater benefits; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 01/03; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0414|SS. Tiburtii, Valeriani et Maximi MM.":{"md":"0414","la":"SS. Tiburtii, Valeriani et Maximi MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Tibúrtii, Valeriáni, et Máximi solémnia cólimus; eórum étiam virtútes imitémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of Your holy Martyrs Tiburtius, Valerian and Maximus may also imitate their virtues; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hæc hóstia, quǽsumus Dómine, quam sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum natalítia recenséntes offérimus, et víncula nostræ pravitátis absólvat, et tuæ nobis misericórdiæ dona concíliet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this sacrifice, which we offer You, O Lord, as we recall the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs, loose the bonds of our sinfulness and win for us the gifts of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sacro múnere satiáti, súpplices te Dómine deprecámur: ut quod débitæ servitútis celebrámus offício; salvatiónis tuæ sentiámus augméntum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the holy gift, we humbly beseech You, O Lord, that what we celebrate in the service we owe You we may feel as an increase of Your salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 14/04; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0428|S. Pauli a Cruce Conf.":{"md":"0428","la":"S. Pauli a Cruce Conf.","or":["Dómine Iesu Christe, qui ad mystérium crucis prædicándum, sanctum Paulum singulári caritáte donásti; et per eum novam in Ecclésia famíliam floréscere voluísti: ipsíus nobis intercessióne concéde; ut passiónem tuam iúgiter recoléntes in terris, eiúsdem fructum cónsequi mereámur in cælis: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O Lord Jesus Christ, who endowed saint Paul with singular charity to preach the mystery of the Cross, and willed that through him a new family should flourish in the Church, grant us by his intercession that, ever recalling Your passion on earth, we may deserve to obtain its fruit in heaven; who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Cæléstem nobis, Dómine, prǽbeant mystéria hæc passiónis et mortis tuæ fervórem, quo sanctus Paulus, ea offeréndo, corpus suum hóstiam vivéntem, sanctam, tibíque placéntem exhíbuit: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May these mysteries, O Lord, give us that fervor for Your passion and death with which saint Paul, in offering them, presented his body to You as a living sacrifice, holy and pleasing to You; who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Súmpsimus, Dómine, divínum sacraméntum, imménsæ caritátis tuæ memoriále perpétuum: tríbue, quǽsumus, ut sancti Pauli méritis et imitatióne, aquam de fóntibus tuis hauriámus in vitam ætérnam saliéntem; et tuam sacratíssimam passiónem córdibus nostris impréssam, móribus et vita teneámus: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We have received, O Lord, the divine sacrament, the everlasting memorial of Your boundless charity; grant, we beseech You, that by the merits and example of saint Paul we may draw from Your fountains water springing up into life eternal, and may hold fast in our conduct and life Your most sacred passion impressed upon our hearts; who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 28/04; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0428|S. Vitalis Mart.":{"md":"0428","la":"S. Vitalis Mart.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut intercedénte beáto Vitále Mártyre tuo, et a cunctis adversitátibus liberémur in córpore; et a pravis cogitatiónibus mundémur in mente: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that at the intercession of blessed Vitalis, Your Martyr, we may be delivered in body from all adversity and cleansed in mind from evil thoughts; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta sit in conspéctu tuo, Dómine, nostra devótio, et eius nobis fiat supplicatióne salutáris, pro cuius solemnitáte defértur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May our devotion be acceptable in Your sight, O Lord, and may it bring us salvation through the prayer of him on whose feast it is offered; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti participatióne múneris sacri, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut cuius exséquimur cultum; intercedénte beáto Vitále Mártyre tuo, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by sharing in the holy gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, at the intercession of blessed Vitalis, Your Martyr, we may feel the effect of the rite we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 28/04; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0503|SS. Alexandri, Eventii et Theoduli MM.":{"md":"0503","la":"SS. Alexandri, Eventii et Theoduli MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui sanctórum tuórum Alexándri, Evéntii, et Theodúli natalítia cólimus; a cunctis malis imminéntibus eórum intercessiónibus liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of Your Saints Alexander, Eventius and Theodulus may by their intercession be delivered from all the evils that threaten us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Super has hóstias, quǽsumus Dómine, benedíctio copiósa descéndat: quæ et sanctificatiónem nobis cleménter operétur, et de Sanctórum nos solemnitáte lætíficet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May a rich blessing come down upon these offerings, we beseech You, O Lord, mercifully work our sanctification, and make us glad in the feast of Your Saints; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti participatióne múneris sacri, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut cuius exséquimur cultum; intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Alexándro, Evéntio, et Theodúlo, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by sharing in the holy gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Alexander, Eventius and Theodulus, we may feel the effect of the rite we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 03/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0510|SS. Gordiani et Epimachi MM.":{"md":"0510","la":"SS. Gordiani et Epimachi MM.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Gordiáni et Epímachi solémnia cólimus; eórum apud te intercessiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of Your blessed Martyrs Gordian and Epimachus may be helped by their intercession with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Gordiáni et Epímachi dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme, et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of Your blessed Martyrs Gordian and Epimachus, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui cæléstia aliménta percépimus; intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Gordiáno et Epímacho, per hæc contra ómnia advérsa muniámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have received the food of heaven may, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Gordian and Epimachus, be fortified by it against all adversity; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 10/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0512|SS. Nerei, Achillei et Pancratii MM.":{"md":"0512","la":"SS. Nerei, Achillei et Pancratii MM.","or":["Semper nos, Dómine, Mártyrum tuórum Nérei, Achíllei, atque Pancrátii fóveat, quǽsumus, beáta solémnitas; et tuo dignos reddat obséquio: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the blessed feast of Your Martyrs Nereus, Achilleus and Pancras ever cherish us, we beseech You, O Lord, and make us worthy of Your service; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum, quǽsumus Dómine, Nérei, Achíllei, atque Pancrátii sit tibi grata conféssio: quæ et múnera nostra comméndet, et tuam nobis indulgéntiam semper implóret: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the confession of Your holy Martyrs Nereus, Achilleus and Pancras be pleasing to You, we beseech You, O Lord; may it commend our gifts and ever implore Your pardon for us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus Dómine, ut beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Nérei, Achíllei, atque Pancrátii deprecatiónibus, sacraménta sancta, quæ súmpsimus; ad tuæ nobis profíciant placatiónis augméntum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We beseech You, O Lord, that through the prayers of Your blessed Martyrs Nereus, Achilleus and Pancras the holy sacraments we have received may profit us for an increase of Your favour; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 12/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0519|S. Pudentianæ Virg.":{"md":"0519","la":"S. Pudentianæ Virg.","or":["Exáudi nos Deus salutáris noster: ut sicut de beátæ Pudentiánæ Vírginis tuæ festivitáte gaudémus; ita piæ devotiónis erudiámur afféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear us, O God our Saviour, that as we rejoice in the feast of blessed Pudentiana, Your Virgin, so we may learn from it the love of a holy devotion; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta tibi sit, Dómine, sacrátæ plebis oblátio pro tuórum honóre Sanctórum, quorum se méritis de tribulatióne percepísse cognóscit auxílium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the offering of Your consecrated people be acceptable to You, O Lord, in honor of Your saints, through whose merits they acknowledge that they have received help in tribulation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 19/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0531|S. Angelæ Mericiæ Virg.":{"md":"0531","la":"S. Angelæ Mericiæ Virg.","or":["Deus, qui novum per beátam Angelam sacrárum Vírginum collégium in Ecclésia tua floréscere voluísti: da nobis, eius intercessióne, angélicis móribus vívere; ut, terrénis ómnibus abdicátis, gáudiis pérfrui mereámur ætérnis. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who through blessed Angela caused a new company of holy virgins to flourish in Your Church, grant us by her intercession to live as the angels live; that, renouncing all earthly things, we may be found worthy to enjoy eternal gladness; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstia, Dómine, quam tibi beátæ Angelæ memóriam recoléntes offérimus, et nostræ pravitátis véniam implóret, et grátiæ tuæ nobis dona concíliet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the sacrifice, O Lord, which we offer You as we recall the memory of blessed Angela, implore pardon for our sinfulness and win for us the gifts of Your grace; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Cælésti alimónia refécti, súpplices te, Dómine, deprecámur; ut beátæ Angelæ précibus et exémplo, ab omni labe mundáti, et córpore tibi placeámus, et mente. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with heavenly food, we humbly beseech You, O Lord, that by the prayers and example of blessed Angela we may be cleansed from every stain and please You both in body and in mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 31/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0531|S. Petronillæ Virg.":{"md":"0531","la":"S. Petronillæ Virg.","or":["Exáudi nos, Deus, salutáris noster: ut, sicut de beátæ Petroníllæ Vírginis tuæ festivitáte gaudémus; ita piæ devotiónis erudiámur afféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear us, O God our Saviour, that as we rejoice in the feast of blessed Petronilla, Your Virgin, so we may learn from it the love of a holy devotion; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta tibi sit, Dómine, sacrátæ plebis oblátio pro tuórum honóre Sanctórum: quorum se méritis de tribulatióne percepísse cognóscit auxílium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the offering of Your consecrated people be acceptable to You, O Lord, in honor of Your saints, through whose merits they acknowledge that they have received help in tribulation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti, Dómine, famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 31/05; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0602|SS. Marcellini Presb. et Petri Exorcistæ MM.":{"md":"0602","la":"SS. Marcellini Presb. et Petri Exorcistæ MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos ánnua beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Marcellíni et Petri solemnitáte lætíficas: præsta quǽsumus, ut quorum gaudémus méritis; provocémur exémplis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of Your blessed Martyrs Marcellinus and Peter, grant, we beseech You, that we may be stirred by the example of those in whose merits we rejoice; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hæc hóstia, quǽsumus Dómine, quam sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum natalítia recenséntes offérimus, et víncula nostræ pravitátis absólvat, et tuæ nobis misericórdiæ dona concíliet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this sacrifice, which we offer You, O Lord, as we recall the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs, loose the bonds of our sinfulness and win for us the gifts of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sacro múnere satiáti, súpplices te Dómine deprecámur: ut quod débitæ servitútis celebrámus offício; salvatiónis tuæ sentiámus augméntum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the holy gift, we humbly beseech You, O Lord, that what we celebrate in the service we owe You we may feel as an increase of Your salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 02/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0608|S. Medardi Ep. et Conf.":{"md":"0608","la":"S. Medardi Ep. et Conf.","or":["Exáudi, quǽsumus Dómine, preces nostras, quas in beáti Medárdi Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis solemnitáte deférimus: ut qui tibi digne méruit famulári; eius intercedéntibus méritis, ab ómnibus nos absólvas peccátis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear, we beseech You, O Lord, the prayers we offer on the feast of blessed Medard, Your Confessor and Bishop; that through the merits of him who was found worthy to serve You, You may absolve us from all our sins; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta sit in conspéctu tuo Dómine nostra devótio: ut eius nobis fiat supplicatióne salutáris, pro cuius solemnitáte defértur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May our devotion be acceptable in Your sight, O Lord, that it may profit us for salvation through the pleading of him on whose feast it is offered; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Da, quǽsumus Dómine, fidélibus tuis, Sanctórum tuórum semper veneratióne lætári; et eórum perpétua supplicatióne muníri: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant to Your faithful, we beseech You, O Lord, ever to rejoice in the veneration of Your saints, and to be fortified by their unceasing prayer; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 08/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0609|SS. Primi et Feliciani MM.":{"md":"0609","la":"SS. Primi et Feliciani MM.","or":["Fac nos, quǽsumus Dómine, sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Primi et Feliciáni semper festa sectári; et eórum suffrágiis protectiónis tuæ dona sentíre: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, ever to keep the feasts of Your holy Martyrs Primus and Felician, and by their prayers to know the gifts of Your protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Fiat tibi, quǽsumus Dómine, hóstia sacránda placábilis, pretiósi celebritáte martýrii: quæ et peccáta nostra puríficet, et tuórum tibi vota concíliet famulórum. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the victim to be hallowed be pleasing to You, we beseech You, O Lord, by the feast of a precious martyrdom; may it cleanse our sins and make the prayers of Your servants acceptable to You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Primi et Feliciáni cæléstibus mystériis celebráta solémnitas; indulgéntiam nobis tuæ propitiatiónis acquírat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the feast of Your holy Martyrs Primus and Felician, celebrated with these heavenly mysteries, may win for us the pardon of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 09/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0612|SS. Basilidis, Cyrini, Naboris et Nazarii MM.":{"md":"0612","la":"SS. Basilidis, Cyrini, Naboris et Nazarii MM.","or":["Sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Basílidis, Cyríni, Nabóris, atque Nazárii, quǽsumus Dómine, natalítia nobis votíva respléndeant: et quod illis cóntulit excelléntia sempitérna; frúctibus nostræ devotiónis accréscat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Basilides, Cyrinus, Nabor and Nazarius shine upon us, we beseech You, O Lord, as we keep it; and may what eternal glory has bestowed on them grow in us through the fruits of our devotion; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Pro sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Basílidis, Cyríni, Nabóris, atque Nazárii sánguine venerándo, hóstias tibi Dómine solémniter immolámus, tua mirabília pertractántes: per quem talis est perfécta victória. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","For the venerable blood of Your holy Martyrs Basilides, Cyrinus, Nabor and Nazarius we solemnly offer You sacrifices, O Lord, recounting Your wonders, by whom such victory was won; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Semper, Dómine, sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Basílidis, Cyríni, Nabóris, atque Nazárii solémnia celebrántes: præsta quǽsumus; ut eórum patrocínia iúgiter sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","As we ever keep the feast of Your holy Martyrs Basilides, Cyrinus, Nabor and Nazarius, O Lord, grant, we beseech You, that we may continually feel their protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 12/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0616|SS. Quirici et Julittæ MM.":{"md":"0616","la":"SS. Quirici et Julittæ MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos concédis sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Quírici et Iulíttæ natalítia cólere; da nobis in ætérna beatitúdine de eórum societáte gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who grant us to keep the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Quiricus and Julitta, grant us to rejoice in their company in everlasting bliss; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, nostræ devotiónis offérimus: quæ et pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre Sanctórum, et nobis salutária, te miseránte, reddántur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our devotion, that they may be pleasing to You for the honor of Your saints and, by Your mercy, become salutary to us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Quírico et Iulítta; ut quæ ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Quiricus and Julitta, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 16/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0618|SS. Marci et Marcelliani MM.":{"md":"0618","la":"SS. Marci et Marcelliani MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus, omnípotens Deus: ut, qui sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Marci et Marcelliáni natalítia cólimus; a cunctis malis imminéntibus, eórum intercessiónibus liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Mark and Marcellian may by their intercession be delivered from all the evils that threaten us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, dicáta sanctífica: et, intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Marco et Marcelliáno, per eádem nos placátus inténde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Sanctify, O Lord, the gifts dedicated to You, and through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Mark and Marcellian look on us with favour because of them; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Salutáris tui, Dómine, múnere satiáti, súpplices exorámus: ut, cuius lætámur gustu; intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Marco et Marcelliáno, renovémur efféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the gift of Your salvation, O Lord, we humbly pray that through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Mark and Marcellian we may be renewed by the effect of what we rejoice to taste; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 18/06; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0701|Octava S. Joannis Baptistæ":{"md":"0701","la":"Octava S. Joannis Baptistæ","or":["Deus, qui præséntem diem honorábilem nobis in beáti Ioánnis nativitáte fecísti: da pópulis tuis spiritálium grátiam gaudiórum; et ómnium fidélium mentes dirige in viam salútis ætérnæ: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, Who made this a day most worthy of our celebration because of blessed John; grant Your people the grace of spiritual joys and direct the minds of all the faithful into the path of eternal salvation. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"se":["Tua, Dómine, munéribus altária cumulámus, illíus nativitátem honóre débito celebrántes, qui Salvatórem mundi et cécinit adfutúrum, et adésse monstrávit: Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We heap Your altar with gifts, O Lord, celebrating the birth of him who announced the coming of the Saviour of the world, our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, and made His presence known. Who livest and reignest with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sumat Ecclésia tua, Deus, beáti Ioánnis Baptístæ generatióne lætítiam; per quem suæ regeneratiónis cognóvit auctórem: Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May Your Church, O God, rejoice at the birth of blessed John the Baptist, through whom she knew the author of her own rebirth, Your Son, our Lord Jesus Christ. Who livest and reignest with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), 1 Jul.: cum Orationibus ut in Festo (p. 474)"},"0702|SS. Processi et Martiniani MM.":{"md":"0702","la":"SS. Processi et Martiniani MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Procéssi et Martiniáni gloriósis confessiónibus circúmdas et prótegis: da nobis et eórum imitatióne profícere; et intercessióne gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who surround and protect us with the glorious confessions of Your holy Martyrs Processus and Martinian, grant us both to profit by imitating them and to rejoice in their intercession; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine preces et múnera: quæ ut tuo sint digna conspéctu, Sanctórum tuórum précibus adiuvémur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, our prayers and gifts; and that they may be worthy in Your sight, may we be helped by the prayers of Your Saints; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Córporis sacri, et pretiósi Sánguinis repléti libámine, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut quod pia devotióne gérimus; certa redemptióne capiámus: Per eúndem Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the draught of the sacred Body and precious Blood, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that what we perform with loving devotion we may receive as sure redemption; through the same Jesus Christ, Your Son, our Lord, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 02/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0720|S. Margaritæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0720","la":"S. Margaritæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Indulgéntiam nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, beáta Margaríta Virgo et Martyr implóret: quæ tibi grata semper éxstitit; et mérito castitátis, et tuæ professióne virtútis. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May blessed Margaret, Virgin and Martyr, implore pardon for us, we beseech You, O Lord, she who was ever pleasing to You by the merit of her chastity and by the profession of Your power; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe, Dómine, múnera, quæ in beátæ Margarítæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte deférimus: cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of blessed Margaret, Your Virgin and Martyr, by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis Dómine sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáta Margaríta Vírgine et Mártyre tua, sempitérna protectióne confírment. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and through the intercession of blessed Margaret, Your Virgin and Martyr, strengthen us with everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 20/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0723|S. Apollinaris Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0723","la":"S. Apollinaris Ep. et Mart.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Apollináris Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis ánnua solemnitáte lætíficas: concéde propítius, ut cuius natalítia cólimus; de eiúsdem étiam protectióne gaudeámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of blessed Apollinaris, Your Martyr and Bishop, mercifully grant that, as we keep his heavenly birthday, we may also rejoice in his protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi Dómine dicáta sanctífica: et intercedénte beáto Apollináre Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, per eádem nos placátus inténde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Sanctify, O Lord, the gifts dedicated to You, and at the intercession of blessed Apollinaris, Your Martyr and Bishop, look on us with favour because of them; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Hæc nos communio, Dómine, purget a crímine; et intercedénte beáto Apollináre Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, cæléstis remédii fáciat esse consórtes: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this communion, O Lord, cleanse us from sin, and at the intercession of blessed Apollinaris, Your Martyr and Bishop, make us partakers of the heavenly remedy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 23/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0724|S. Christinæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0724","la":"S. Christinæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Indulgéntiam nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, beáta Christína Virgo et Martyr implóret: quæ tibi grata semper éxstitit; et mérito castitátis, et tuæ professióne virtútis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May blessed Christina, Virgin and Martyr, implore pardon for us, we beseech You, O Lord, she who was ever pleasing to You by the merit of her chastity and by the profession of Your power; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in beátæ Christínæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solemnitáte deférimus: cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of blessed Christina, Your Virgin and Martyr, by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáta Christína Vírgine et Mártyre tua, sempitérna protectióne confírment: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and through the intercession of blessed Christina, Your Virgin and Martyr, strengthen us with everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 24/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0725|SS. Christophori et Cucuphatis MM.":{"md":"0725","la":"SS. Christophori et Cucuphatis MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui gloriósos Mártyres tuos Christóphorum et Cucuphátem fortes in sua confessióne cognóvimus; pios apud te in nostra intercessióne sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have known Your glorious Martyrs Christopher and Cucuphas to be brave in their confession may find them kind in interceding for us with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sacrifíciis præséntibus, quǽsumus Dómine, inténde placátus: et intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis, devotióni nostræ profíciant, et salúti. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Look with favour, we beseech You, O Lord, on the sacrifice here present; and through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs may it profit our devotion and our salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Christóphoro et Cucupháte, illíus salutáris capiámus efféctum; cuius per hæc mystéria pignus accépimus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Christopher and Cucuphas we may receive the effect of that salvation whose pledge we have taken in these mysteries; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 25/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0728|SS. Nazarii, Celsi et Pantaleonis MM.":{"md":"0728","la":"SS. Nazarii, Celsi et Pantaleonis MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos concédis sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Nazárii, Celsi, et Pantaleónis natalítia cólere; da nobis in ætérna beatitúdine de eórum societáte gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who grant us to keep the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Nazarius, Celsus and Pantaleon, grant us to rejoice in their company in everlasting bliss; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, nostræ devotiónis offérimus: quæ et pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre Sanctórum, et nobis salutária, te miseránte, reddántur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our devotion, that they may be pleasing to You for the honor of Your saints and, by Your mercy, become salutary to us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Nazário, Celso, et Pantaleóne; ut quæ ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Nazarius, Celsus and Pantaleon, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 28/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0729|SS. Felicis, Simplicii, Faustini et Beatricis MM.":{"md":"0729","la":"SS. Felicis, Simplicii, Faustini et Beatricis MM.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus Dómine: ut sicut pópulus Christiánus Mártyrum tuórum Felícis, Simplícii, Faustíni, et Beatrícis temporáli solemnitáte congáudet, ita perfruátur ætérna; et quod votis celébrat, comprehéndat efféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, O Lord, that as the Christian people rejoice in the feast in time of Your Martyrs Felix, Simplicius, Faustinus and Beatrice, they may enjoy it in eternity, and attain in effect what they celebrate in prayer; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, pro sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Felícis, Simplícii, Faustíni, et Beatrícis commemoratióne deférimus, supplíciter deprecántes, ut indulgéntiam nobis páriter cónferant, et salútem. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You sacrifices, O Lord, in commemoration of Your holy Martyrs Felix, Simplicius, Faustinus and Beatrice, humbly praying that they may bring us both pardon and salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Felícis, Simplícii, Faustíni, et Beatrícis cæléstibus mystériis celebráta solémnitas; indulgéntiam nobis tuæ propitiatiónis acquírat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that the feast of Your holy Martyrs Felix, Simplicius, Faustinus and Beatrice, celebrated with these heavenly mysteries, may win for us the pardon of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 29/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0730|SS. Abdon et Sennen MM.":{"md":"0730","la":"SS. Abdon et Sennen MM.","or":["Deus, qui sanctis tuis Abdon et Sennen ad hanc glóriam veniéndi copiósum munus grátiæ contulísti; da fámulis tuis suórum véniam peccatórum: ut Sanctórum tuórum intercedéntibus méritis; ab ómnibus mereámur adversitátibus liberári: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who granted Your Saints Abdon and Sennen the abundant gift of grace to come to this glory, give Your servants the pardon of their sins; that through the merits of Your Saints we may be found worthy to be delivered from all adversity; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hæc hóstia, quǽsumus Dómine, quam sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum natalítia recenséntes offérimus, et víncula nostræ pravitátis absólvat, et tuæ nobis misericórdiæ dona concíliet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this sacrifice, which we offer You, O Lord, as we recall the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs, loose the bonds of our sinfulness and win for us the gifts of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Per huius, Dómine, operatiónem mystérii, et vítia nostra purgéntur; et intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Abdon et Sennen, iusta desidéria compleántur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","By the working of this mystery, O Lord, may our faults be cleansed, and through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Abdon and Sennen may our just desires be fulfilled; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 30/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0731|S. Germani Ep. et Conf.":{"md":"0731","la":"S. Germani Ep. et Conf.","or":["Exáudi, quǽsumus Dómine, preces nostras, quas in beáti Germáni Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis solemnitáte deférimus: ut qui tibi digne méruit famulári; eius intercedéntibus méritis, ab ómnibus nos absólvas peccátis: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear, we beseech You, O Lord, the prayers we offer on the feast of blessed Germanus, Your Confessor and Bishop; that through the merits of him who was found worthy to serve You, You may absolve us from all our sins; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta sit in conspéctu tuo Dómine nostra devótio: ut eius nobis fiat supplicatióne salutáris, pro cuius solemnitáte defértur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May our devotion be acceptable in Your sight, O Lord, that it may profit us for salvation through the pleading of him on whose feast it is offered; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Da, quǽsumus Dómine, fidélibus tuis, Sanctórum tuórum semper veneratióne lætári; et eórum perpétua supplicatióne muníri: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant to Your faithful, we beseech You, O Lord, ever to rejoice in the veneration of Your saints, and to be fortified by their unceasing prayer; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 31/07; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0801|SS. Machabæorum MM.":{"md":"0801","la":"SS. Machabæorum MM.","or":["Fratérna nos, Dómine, Mártyrum tuórum coróna lætíficet: quæ et fídei nostræ præbeat increménta virtútum; et multíplici nos suffrágio consolétur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the crown of Your brother Martyrs gladden us, O Lord; may it add the growth of virtues to our faith, and console us by their manifold intercession; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Votíva nos, Dómine, mystéria pro sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum constántia devóta mente tractánda sanctíficent: quibus et præsídium nobis crescat, et gáudium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the votive mysteries, to be handled with devout mind in honour of the constancy of Your holy Martyrs, sanctify us, O Lord, and through them may our protection and our joy increase; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut quorum memóriam sacraménti participatióne recólimus; fidem quoque proficiéndo sectémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who recall the memory of these Martyrs by sharing in the sacrament may also, growing in grace, follow their faith; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 01/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0802|S. Stephani I Papæ et Mart.":{"md":"0802","la":"S. Stephani I Papæ et Mart.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Stéphani Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis ánnua solemnitáte lætíficas: concéde propítius, ut cuius natalítia cólimus; de eiúsdem étiam protectióne gaudeámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of blessed Stephen, Your Martyr and Bishop, mercifully grant that, as we keep his heavenly birthday, we may also rejoice in his protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi Dómine dicáta sanctífica: et intercedénte beáto Stéphano Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, per eádem nos placátus inténde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Sanctify, O Lord, the gifts dedicated to You, and at the intercession of blessed Stephen, Your Martyr and Bishop, look on us with favour because of them; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Hæc nos communio, Dómine, purget a crímine; et intercedénte beáto Stéphano Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, cæléstis remédii fáciat esse consórtes: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this communion, O Lord, cleanse us from sin, and at the intercession of blessed Stephen, Your Martyr and Bishop, make us partakers of the heavenly remedy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 02/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0803|Inventio Corporis S. Stephani Protomartyris":{"md":"0803","la":"Inventio Corporis S. Stephani Protomartyris","or":["Da nobis, quǽsumus, Dómine, imitári quod cólimus, ut discámus et inimícos dilígere: quia eius córporis Inventiónem celebrámus; qui novit étiam pro persecutóribus exoráre: Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, to imitate what we honour, that we may learn to love even our enemies; for we celebrate the finding of the body of him who knew how to pray even for his persecutors; who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera pro tuórum commemoratióne Sanctórum: ut sicut illos pássio gloriósos effécit, ita nos devótio reddat innócuos. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, these gifts in commemoration of Your saints, that, as their passion made them glorious, so our devotion may make us blameless; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Auxiliéntur nobis, Dómine, sumpta mystéria; et intercedénte beáto Stéphano Mártyre tuo, sempitérna protectióne confírment: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the mysteries we have received help us, O Lord, and, by the intercession of blessed Stephen Your martyr, strengthen us with everlasting protection; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 03/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0806|SS. Xysti II Papæ, Felicissimi et Agapiti MM.":{"md":"0806","la":"SS. Xysti II Papæ, Felicissimi et Agapiti MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos concédis sanctórum Mártyrum tuórum Xysti, Felicíssimi, et Agapíti natalítia cólere; da nobis in ætérna beatitúdine de eórum societáte gaudére: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who grant us to keep the heavenly birthday of Your holy Martyrs Sixtus, Felicissimus and Agapitus, grant us to rejoice in their company in everlasting bliss; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Múnera tibi, Dómine, nostræ devotiónis offérimus: quæ et pro tuórum tibi grata sint honóre Sanctórum, et nobis salutária, te miseránte, reddántur. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, the gifts of our devotion, that they may be pleasing to You for the honor of Your saints and, by Your mercy, become salutary to us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Præsta nobis, quǽsumus Dómine, intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Xysto, Felicíssimo, et Agapíto; ut quæ ore contígimus, pura mente capiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, O Lord, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Sixtus, Felicissimus and Agapitus, that what we have taken with our lips we may receive with a pure mind; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 06/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0807|S. Donati Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0807","la":"S. Donati Ep. et Mart.","or":["Deus, tuórum glória sacerdótum: præsta quǽsumus, ut sancti Mártyris tui et Epíscopi Donáti, cuius festa gérimus; sentiámus auxílium: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, the glory of Your priests, grant, we beseech You, that we may feel the help of Your holy Martyr and Bishop Donatus, whose feast we keep; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Præsta, quǽsumus Dómine, ut sancti Mártyris tui et Epíscopi Donáti intercessióne, quem ad laudem nóminis tui dicátis munéribus honorámus, piæ nobis fructus devotiónis accréscat. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, O Lord, that through the intercession of Your holy Martyr and Bishop Donatus, whom we honour with gifts dedicated to the praise of Your name, the fruit of loving devotion may grow in us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Omnípotens et miséricors Deus, qui nos sacramentórum tuórum et partícipes éfficis, et minístros: præsta quǽsumus, ut intercedénte beáto Donáto Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice; eiúsdem proficiámus et fídei consórtio, et digno servítio: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Almighty and merciful God, who make us both partakers and ministers of Your sacraments, grant, we beseech You, that at the intercession of blessed Donatus, Your Martyr and Bishop, we may grow both in fellowship of his faith and in worthy service; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 07/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0808|SS. Cyriaci, Largi et Smaragdi MM.":{"md":"0808","la":"SS. Cyriaci, Largi et Smaragdi MM.","or":["Deus, qui nos ánnua beatórum Mártyrum tuórum Cyríaci, Largi, et Smarágdi solemnitáte lætíficas: concéde propítius, ut quorum natalítia cólimus; virtútem quoque passiónis imitémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of Your blessed Martyrs Cyriacus, Largus and Smaragdus, mercifully grant that, as we keep their heavenly birthday, we may also imitate the courage of their passion; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti tui, quǽsumus Dómine, nos ubíque lætíficent: ut dum eórum mérita recólimus, patrocínia sentiámus. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your saints, O Lord, everywhere make us glad; that while we remember their merits we may experience their help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti participatióne múneris sacri, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut cuius exséquimur cultum; intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Cyríaco, Largo, et Smarágdo, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by sharing in the holy gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Cyriacus, Largus and Smaragdus, we may feel the effect of the rite we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 08/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0811|S. Tiburtii Mart.":{"md":"0811","la":"S. Tiburtii Mart.","or":["Beáti Tibúrtii Mártyris tui nos, Dómine, fóveant continuáta præsídia: quia non désinis propítius intuéri; quos tálibus auxíliis concésseris adiuvári: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the unceasing protection of blessed Tiburtius, Your Martyr, cherish us, O Lord; for You never cease to look with favour on those whom You grant to be helped by such aid; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Adésto Dómine précibus pópuli tui, adésto munéribus: ut quæ sacris sunt obláta mystériis, tuórum tibi pláceant intercessióne Sanctórum. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Be present, O Lord, to the prayers of Your people, be present to their gifts; that what is offered in these holy mysteries may please You through the intercession of Your Saints; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Súmpsimus, Dómine, pignus redemptiónis ætérnæ; quod sit nobis, quǽsumus, interveniénte beáto Tibúrtio Mártyre tuo, vitæ præséntis auxílium, páriter et futúræ: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We have received, O Lord, the pledge of eternal redemption; may it be for us, we beseech You, at the intercession of blessed Tiburtius, Your Martyr, a help for this life and for the life to come; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 11/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0814|S. Eusebii Presb. et Conf.":{"md":"0814","la":"S. Eusebii Presb. et Conf.","or":["Deus, qui nos beáti Eusébii Confessóris tui ánnua solemnitáte lætíficas: concéde propítius, ut cuius natalítia cólimus; per eius ad te exémpla gradiámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who gladden us by the yearly feast of blessed Eusebius, Your Confessor, mercifully grant that we who keep his heavenly birthday may come to You by following his example; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Laudis tibi Dómine hóstias immolámus in tuórum commemoratióne Sanctórum: quibus nos et præséntibus éxui malis confídimus, et futúris. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We offer You, O Lord, victims of praise in memory of Your saints; and trust thereby to be freed from all ills both present and to come; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti cibo potúque cælésti, Deus noster, te súpplices exorámus: ut in cuius hæc commemoratióne percépimus; eius muniámur et précibus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with this heavenly food and drink, O our God, we humbly pray that we may be helped by the prayers of him in whose memory we have received it; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 14/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0817|Octava S. Laurentii":{"md":"0817","la":"Octava S. Laurentii","or":["Da nobis, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus, vitiórum nostrórum flammas exstínguere; qui beáto Lauréntio tribuísti tormentórum suórum incéndia superáre: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant us, we beseech You, almighty God, to extinguish the flames of our sins, as You granted St. Lawrence to overcome the fires of his tortures. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"se":["Accipe, quǽsumus Dómine, múnera dignánter obláta: et beáti Lauréntii suffragántibus méritis, ad nostræ salútis auxílium proveníre concéde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts fully offered to You, and, by the interceding merits of blessed Lawrence, Your Martyr, grant they may further our salvation. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sacro múnere satiáti, súpplices te Dómine deprecámur: ut quod débitæ servitútis celebrámus offício; intercedénte beáto Lauréntio Mártyre tuo, salvatiónis tuæ sentiámus augméntum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with Your sacred gifts, we humbly pray You, O Lord, that as we perform this sacred act in duty bound, we may, through the intercession of Your blessed Martyr Lawrence, enjoy an increase of Your saving grace. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 17/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0818|S. Agapiti Mart.":{"md":"0818","la":"S. Agapiti Mart.","or":["Lætétur Ecclésia tua, Deus, beáti Agapíti Mártyris tui confísa suffrágiis: atque eius précibus gloriósis, et devóta permáneat; et secúra consístat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Let Your Church rejoice, O God, trusting in the prayers of blessed Agapitus, Your Martyr; and by his glorious intercession may she remain devout and stand secure; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera, quæ in eius tibi solemnitáte deférimus, cuius nos confídimus patrocínio liberári. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, O Lord, the gifts we bring You on the feast of him by whose patronage we trust to be set free; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, semper interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with sacred gifts; ever refresh us, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 18/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0822|SS. Timothei et Symphoriani MM.":{"md":"0822","la":"SS. Timothei et Symphoriani MM.","or":["Auxílium tuum nobis, Dómine quǽsumus, placátus impénde: et intercedéntibus beátis Martýribus tuis Timótheo atque Symphoriáno; déxteram super nos tuæ propitiatiónis exténde: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously grant us Your help, we beseech You, O Lord, and through the intercession of Your blessed Martyrs Timothy and Symphorian stretch out over us the right hand of Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta tibi sit, Dómine, sacrátæ plebis oblátio pro tuórum honóre Sanctórum, quorum se méritis de tribulatióne percepísse cognóscit auxílium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the offering of Your consecrated people be acceptable to You, O Lord, in honor of Your saints, through whose merits they acknowledge that they have received help in tribulation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Divíni múneris largitáte satiáti, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut intercedéntibus sanctis Martýribus tuis Timótheo et Symphoriáno; in eius semper participatióne vivámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the bounty of the divine gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that through the intercession of Your holy Martyrs Timothy and Symphorian we may ever live by sharing in it; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 22/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0827|S. Rufi Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0827","la":"S. Rufi Ep. et Mart.","or":["Adésto Dómine supplicatiónibus nostris: ut qui ex iniquitáte nostra reos nos esse cognóscimus; beáti Rufi Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis intercessióne liberémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hear our supplications, O Lord, that we who know ourselves guilty through our iniquity may be set free by the intercession of blessed Rufus, Your Martyr and Bishop; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Munéribus nostris, quǽsumus Dómine, precibúsque suscéptis: intercedénte beáto Rufo Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, et cæléstibus nos munda mystériis, et cleménter exáudi. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive our gifts and prayers, we beseech You, O Lord; and at the intercession of blessed Rufus, Your Martyr and Bishop, cleanse us by these heavenly mysteries and graciously hear us; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui cæléstia aliménta percépimus; intercedénte beáto Rufo Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, per hæc contra ómnia advérsa muniámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who have received the food of heaven may, at the intercession of blessed Rufus, Your Martyr and Bishop, be fortified by it against all adversity; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 27/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0829|S. Sabinæ Mart.":{"md":"0829","la":"S. Sabinæ Mart.","or":["Deus, qui inter cétera poténtiæ tuæ mirácula, étiam in sexu frágili victóriam martýrii contulísti: concéde propítius, ut qui beátæ Sabínæ Mártyris tuæ natalítia cólimus; per eius ad te exémpla gradiámur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","O God, who among the other wonders of Your power have given even to the weaker sex the victory of martyrdom, mercifully grant that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Sabina, Your Martyr, may come to You by following her example; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beátæ Sabínæ Mártyris tuæ dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme: et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of blessed Sabina, Your Martyr, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Divíni múneris largitáte satiáti, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut intercedénte beáta Sabína Mártyre tua; in eius semper participatióne vivámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with the bounty of the divine gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that at the intercession of blessed Sabina, Your Martyr, we may ever live by sharing in it; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 29/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0830|SS. Felicis et Adaucti MM.":{"md":"0830","la":"SS. Felicis et Adaucti MM.","or":["Maiestátem tuam, Dómine, súpplices exorámus: ut sicut nos iúgiter Sanctórum tuórum commemoratióne lætíficas; ita semper supplicatióne deféndas: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","We humbly pray Your majesty, O Lord, that as You continually gladden us with the commemoration of Your Saints, so You may ever defend us by their prayers; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias, Dómine, tuæ plebis inténde: et quas in honórem Sanctórum tuórum devóta mente celébrat, profícere sibi séntiat ad salútem. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Look, O Lord, on the offerings of Your people; and may what they celebrate with devout mind in honour of Your Saints be felt by them as profitable for salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Repléti, Dómine, munéribus sacris; quǽsumus, ut intercedéntibus Sanctis tuis, in gratiárum semper actióne maneámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Filled with these holy gifts, O Lord, we beseech You that, through the intercession of Your Saints, we may ever continue in giving thanks; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 30/08; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0904|Octava S. Augustini":{"md":"0904","la":"Octava S. Augustini","or":["Adésto supplicatiónibus nostris omnípotens Deus: et quibus fidúciam sperándæ pietátis indúlges; intercedénte beáto Augustíno Confessóre tuo atque Pontífice, consuétæ misericórdiæ tríbue benígnus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Hearken to our supplications, almighty God, and, blessed Augustine, Your confessor and bishop, interceding, graciously grant the effect of Your wonted mercy to those to whom You give confidence to hope for Your loving-kindness; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Sancti Confessóris tui atque Pontíficis Augustíni nobis, Dómine, pia non desit orátio: quæ et múnera nostra concíliet, et tuam nobis indulgéntiam semper obtíneat. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the loving prayer of Your holy confessor and bishop Augustine not fail us, O Lord, that it may make our gifts acceptable and ever obtain for us Your pardon; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Ut nobis, Dómine, tua sacrifícia dent salútem; beátus Conféssor tuus Augustínus, et Póntifex, quǽsumus, precátor accédat: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","That Your sacrifices may give us salvation, O Lord, may blessed Augustine, Your confessor and bishop, we beseech You, come forward as our advocate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 04/09; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0904|S. Marcelli Mart.":{"md":"0904","la":"S. Marcelli Mart.","or":["Præsta, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beáti Marcélli Mártyris tui natalítia cólimus; eius intercessióne in tui nóminis amóre roborémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the heavenly birthday of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr, may by his intercession be strengthened in the love of Your name; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias tibi, Dómine, beáti Marcélli Mártyris tui dicátas méritis, benígnus assúme: et ad perpétuum nobis tríbue proveníre subsídium. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Graciously accept, O Lord, the offerings dedicated to the merits of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr, and grant that they may avail us for lasting help; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Sumptis, Dómine, sacraméntis: quǽsumus, ut intercedénte beáto Marcéllo Mártyre tuo; supplicatiónes nostras placátus inténdas: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Having received Your sacraments, O Lord, we beseech You that, at the intercession of blessed Marcellus, Your Martyr, You may look with favour on our supplications; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 04/09; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0915|S. Nicomedis Mart.":{"md":"0915","la":"S. Nicomedis Mart.","or":["Adésto Dómine pópulo tuo: ut beáti Nicomédis Mártyris tui mérita præclára suscípiens; ad impetrándam misericórdiam tuam semper eius patrocíniis adiuvétur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Be with Your people, O Lord, that, honouring the glorious merits of blessed Nicomedes, Your Martyr, they may ever be helped by his patronage to obtain Your mercy; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Súscipe Dómine múnera propítius obláta, quæ maiestáti tuæ beáti Nicomédis Mártyris tui comméndet orátio. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Mercifully receive, O Lord, the gifts we offer, and may the prayer of blessed Nicomedes, Your Martyr, commend them to Your majesty; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Puríficent nos, quǽsumus Dómine, sacraménta quæ súmpsimus; et intercedénte beáto Nicoméde Mártyre tuo, a cunctis effíciant vítiis absolútos: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May the sacraments we have received cleanse us, we beseech You, O Lord, and at the intercession of blessed Nicomedes, Your Martyr, free us from all vices; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 15/09; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0916|S. Euphemiæ Virg. et Mart.":{"md":"0916","la":"S. Euphemiæ Virg. et Mart.","or":["Omnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui infírma mundi éligis, ut fórtia quæque confúndas: concéde propítius, ut qui beátæ Euphémiæ Vírginis et Mártyris tuæ solémnia cólimus; eius apud te patrocínia sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Almighty, everlasting God, who choose the weak things of the world to confound the strong, mercifully grant that we who keep the feast of blessed Euphemia, Your Virgin and Martyr, may feel her patronage with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hóstias, Dómine, quas tibi offérimus, propítius súscipe: et intercedénte beáta Euphémia Vírgine et Mártyre tua, víncula peccatórum nostrórum absólve. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Mercifully receive, O Lord, the offerings we make You, and at the intercession of blessed Euphemia, Your Virgin and Martyr, loose the bonds of our sins; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti cibo, potúque cælésti, Deus noster, te súpplices exorámus: ut in cuius hæc commemoratióne percépimus; eius muniámur et précibus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed with heavenly food and drink, O our God, we humbly entreat You that we may also be defended by the prayers of her in whose commemoration we have received these gifts; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 16/09; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"0917|S. Lamberti Ep. et Mart.":{"md":"0917","la":"S. Lamberti Ep. et Mart.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beáti Lambérti Mártyris tui atque Pontíficis solémnia cólimus; eius apud te intercessiónibus adiuvémur: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of blessed Lambert, Your Martyr and Bishop, may be helped by his intercession with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Hæc hóstia, quǽsumus Dómine, emúndet nostra delícta: et ad sacrifícium celebrándum, subditórum tibi córpora mentésque sanctíficet. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May this victim, we beseech You, O Lord, cleanse our sins, and sanctify the bodies and minds of Your servants for the offering of this sacrifice; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Refécti participatióne múneris sacri, quǽsumus Dómine Deus noster: ut cuius exséquimur cultum; intercedénte beáto Lambérto Mártyre tuo atque Pontífice, sentiámus efféctum: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by sharing in the holy gift, we beseech You, O Lord our God, that, at the intercession of blessed Lambert, Your Martyr and Bishop, we may feel the effect of the rite we celebrate; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), in the Mass of 17/09; English translated for this site (AI) where not already on the site"},"1225|S. Anastasiæ Mart.":{"md":"1225","la":"S. Anastasiæ Mart.","or":["Da, quǽsumus omnípotens Deus: ut qui beátæ Anastásiæ Mártyris tuæ solémnia cólimus; eius apud te patrocínia sentiámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Grant, we beseech You, almighty God, that we who keep the feast of blessed Anastasia, Your Martyr, may feel her patronage with You; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accipe, quǽsumus Dómine, múnera dignánter obláta: et beátæ Anastásiæ Mártyris tuæ suffragántibus méritis, ad nostræ salútis auxílium proveníre concéde. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Receive, we beseech You, O Lord, the gifts we offer, and grant that, through the merits of blessed Anastasia, Your Martyr, they may avail for our salvation; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"pc":["Satiásti Dómine famíliam tuam munéribus sacris: eius, quǽsumus, interventióne nos réfove; cuius solémnia celebrámus: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","You have filled Your household, O Lord, with holy gifts; refresh us ever, we beseech You, by the intercession of her whose feast we keep; through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), Christmas, second Mass: Memoria de S. Anastasia (pp. 21-22); English translated for this site (AI)"},"Adv3w|Feria IV Quatuor Temporum Adventus":{"md":"1200","la":"Feria IV Quatuor Temporum Adventus","or":["Festína, quǽsumus Dómine, ne tardáveris: et auxílium nobis supérnæ virtútis impénde; ut advéntus tui consolatiónibus sublevéntur, qui in tua pietáte confídunt: Qui vivis et regnas cum Deo Patre; in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Make haste, we beseech You, O Lord, do not delay, and grant us the help of Your heavenly power; that they who trust in Your goodness may be relieved by the consolations of Your coming; who live and reign with God the Father, in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, world without end."],"se":["Accépta tibi sint, quǽsumus Dómine, nostra ieiúnia, quæ et expiándo nos tua grátia dignos effíciant, et ad sempitérna promíssa perdúcant. Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","May our fasting, we beseech You, O Lord, be acceptable to You, and by its purifying power make us worthy of Your grace and bring us to the eternal bliss You have promised us. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"pc":["Salutáris tui Dómine múnere satiáti, súpplices deprecámur: ut cuius lætámur gustu; renovémur efféctu: Per Dóminum nostrum Iesum Christum Fílium tuum; qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitáte Spíritus Sancti Deus: per ómnia sǽcula sæculórum.","Refreshed by the sacramental gift of Your salvation, we humbly beseech You, O Lord, that enjoying its savor we may be made new by its action. Through Jesus Christ, thy Son our Lord, Who liveth and reigneth with thee, in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end."],"src":"Missale O.P. (1939), Feria IV Quatuor Temporum Adventus: the Oratio Festina for its commemoration in the Mass of a feast"}};
